{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalLagrangianExists","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalLagrangianExists","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.QDifferentialGeometry","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Linear.Basic"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalLagrangian.exists","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalLagrangian.exists","kind":"theorem","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-lagrangian-exists.lean#L28-L52","doc":"**Existence of the categorical Lagrangian.**\n\nIn an `R`-linear monoidal category `C`, for any Dirac operator `D`, state\n`ψ`, and costate `ψ*`, there exists a `CategoricalLagrangian R C fh` whose\n`lagrangian` endomorphism is exactly `𝒟_∇² + ψ* ⊗ 𝒟_∇ψ`.\n\nThis replaces the earlier `Nonempty (CategoricalLagrangian C fh)` proved\nby a trivial identity witness: the existential now pins the `lagrangian`\nfield to the defining formula of [`def:categorical-lagrangian`]. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:categorical-lagrangian-exists","label":"prop:categorical-lagrangian-exists","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-lagrangian-exists.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}